{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "remarks", "parent_tag": "03O6", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\v C", "GROUPCLOSE_0001": "}", "GROUPOPEN_0001": "{", "MATH_0001": "$\\{\\Spec(B) \\to \\Spec(A)\\}$", "MATH_0002": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0003": "$(N, \\varphi)$", "MATH_0004": "$A \\to B$", "MATH_0005": "$A$", "MATH_0006": "$$\nM = \\Ker \\left(\n\\begin{matrix}\nN & \\longrightarrow & B \\otimes_A N \\\\\nn & \\longmapsto & 1 \\otimes n - \\varphi(n \\otimes 1)\n\\end{matrix}\n\\right).\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{descent-proposition-descent-module}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{remarks}\n\\label{remarks-theorem-modules-exactness}\n", "suffix": "\\end{remarks}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a0c6a79b35c2e474f95f3d115221cc979e9f541fedc417b549f6fb4dd83c3424", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:42a46c7cba63a643af81037830e94e19d0a0d87f123ee2383a6b472af1ca0a52", "source_text": "The results on descent of modules have several applications:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The exactness of the <GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech complex in positive degrees for\nthe covering <MATH_0001> where <MATH_0002> is\nfaithfully flat. This will give some vanishing of cohomology.\n<STRUCT_0003> If <MATH_0003> is a descent datum with respect to a faithfully\nflat map <MATH_0004>, then the corresponding <MATH_0005>-module is given by\n<MATH_0006>\nSee\nDescent, Proposition <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:73d289d2415aae6df627e10fe0a23ae29ab522a308cfc3a05674703702e90507", "unit_id": "tag:03OE:statement"}
